cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Thermograph: bounded exact short games and approximate thermography"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Nicholson
    given-names: Devin
repository-code: "https://github.com/devinnicholson/thermograph"
url: "https://github.com/devinnicholson/thermograph"
abstract: >-
  Rust research software for bounded exact comparison, semantic canonical
  forms, a complete birthday-three value catalogue, exact dyadic arithmetic,
  stable structural game-tree payloads, and approximate floating-point
  thermography of finite normal-play partizan games.
keywords:
  - combinatorial game theory
  - canonical form
  - short games
  - thermography
  - surreal numbers
  - reproducible research
